      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing unused imports, fields (`A_FILTER`, `B_FILTER`), and helper methods (`codePointLength`)\n2. Renaming `pairs` to `ranges` for clarity\n3. Splitting declaration of `minCodePoint`/`maxCodePoint`\n4. Extracting the code point iteration into a descriptive helper method\n5. Converting the `do-while` to a more natural `while` loop\n6. Adding a meaningful failure message to the assertion\n7. Formatting the builder chain readably (removing `@formatter` directives)The improved test compiled successfully."
